  "document": "Her Husband's Trademark\nHer Husband's Trademark is a 1922 American silent drama film directed by Sam Wood and starring Gloria Swanson and Richard Wayne. Produced by Famous Players- Lasky and distributed by Paramount Pictures, the film was shot on location in El Paso, Texas. Prints of\" Her Husband's Trademark\" are held at the George Eastman House and the Gosfilmofond archive in Moscow."
